            <span class="mk">As of 2023-24</span>
            <p>Basic metals lead at <b id="ex-i1">–</b> of factory GVA, with motor vehicles at <b id="ex-i2">–</b> and chemicals at <b id="ex-i3">–</b>. The five accented panels together hold <b id="ex-i5">–</b> of everything the factory sector adds.</p>
