            <span class="mk">As of 2023-24</span>
            <p>The largest employer is <b id="ex-lb1">–</b>, followed by <b id="ex-lb2">–</b> and <b id="ex-lb3">–</b>. The top five together hold <b id="ex-lb5">–</b> of all factory employment.</p>
