            <div class="sub">Women's share of workers in unincorporated non-farm enterprises, by detailed activity, 2025, activities with at least five lakh workers, sorted; the dashed line is all activities</div>
          </div>
          <div class="plate-val"><div class="v" id="pv-women">–</div><div class="c">women's share, all informal workers, 2025</div></div>
